<td id="S1.T1.4.1.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">FinSearchComp <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hu et al., 2025</a>)</cite></td>
